# The microwave app is a companion tool for separate work. It stays in the
# repository -- the two solvers still trade patterns, and the microwave app's
# next step is adopting the Joule solver's Krylov solve -- but it is excluded
# from release archives so that a DOI minted for a paper covers only what that
# paper is accountable for. Two lines, reversible, and the working tree is
# untouched: this affects `git archive` output, which is what GitHub's release
# tarballs and therefore Zenodo's snapshots are built from.
apps/microwave export-ignore
tools/verification/microwave-field.mjs export-ignore
tools/verification/microwave-calibrate.mjs export-ignore
tools/verification/microwave.mjs export-ignore
tests/microwave-solver.test.js export-ignore
